WEBVTT

16:31.065 --> 16:34.859
Yes, it is a mistake because,
you see, the bed here is my spot.

16:34.944 --> 16:36.527
I need to repair
my turbo boosters.

16:36.612 --> 16:39.739
Do you people still use fossil fuel, or
have you discovered crystallic fusion?

16:39.823 --> 16:41.783
Well, let's see. We got double-A's.

16:42.326 --> 16:44.244
Watch yourself!
Halt! Who goes there?

16:44.328 --> 16:46.704
Don't shoot!
It's okay. Friends.

16:46.789 --> 16:50.541
-Do you know these life-forms?
-Yes! They're Andy's toys.

16:50.626 --> 16:53.002
All right, everyone,
you're clear to come up.

16:53.087 --> 16:55.713
I am Buzz Lightyear.
I come in peace.

16:55.798 --> 16:59.133
Oh, I'm so glad
you're not a dinosaur!

16:59.677 --> 17:01.386
Wh-why, thank you!
